@page "/components/toast"

<PageTitle>Toast — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Toast</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    shadcn's own toast is deprecated in favour of Sonner, and its docs page says so. This is
    Sonner's API over Toastify: <code>toast(...)</code>, <code>toast.error(...)</code> — the same
    shape at the call site, so a model that knows sonner writes it correctly first time.
</p>

